410: ## Testing Multiple Platforms
411: 
412: ### Platform Detection Test
413: 
414: ```dart
415: testWidgets('works on all platforms', (tester) async {
416:   final plugin = MyPlugin();
417:   final platform = await plugin.getPlatform();
418:   
419:   if (Platform.isAndroid) {
420:     expect(platform, contains('Android'));
421:   } else if (Platform.isIOS) {
422:     expect(platform, contains('iOS'));
423:   }
424: });
425: ```
